:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM10 HELP=HLP10 KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Installed Licensed Programs
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=INSTALLED SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STATUS'.Installed Status
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=44 HELP='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM10R HELP=HLP10 KEYL=RLSKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Installed Licensed Programs
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=INSTALLED SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPRLS'.Installed Release
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPOPT'.Product Option
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM11 HELP=HLP11 KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Install Licensed Programs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROGRAMS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs to install)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 101' HELP='LICPGM11/OPTIONS'.1=Install
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='LICPGM11/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPOPT'.Product Option
:LISTCOL VAR=STATUS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STATUS'.Installed Status
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=36 HELP='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICINSOPT HELP=HLPINS KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Install Options
:TOPINST.Type choices, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=INSDEV USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/INSDEV'.Installation device (save file)
:DATAI VAR=INSOBJ USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/INSOBJ'.Objects to install
:DATAI VAR=INSIPL USAGE=INOUT HELP='FLD/INSIPL'.Automatic IPL
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Objects: 1=Programs and language objects, 2=Programs, 3=Language objects
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICAGREE HELP=HLPAGR KEYL=AGRKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Software Agreement
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATAI VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed program
:DATAI VAR=LPRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPRLS'.Release
:DATAI VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AGRTEXT SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=AGRLINE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AGRLINE'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.F14 accepts the agreement; F15 declines it and the program is not installed.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM12 HELP=HLP12 KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Delete Licensed Programs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROGRAMS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD DLTLICPGM LICPGM(&LPID.) OPTION(&LPOPT.)' HELP='LICPGM12/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='LICPGM12/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPOPT'.Product Option
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=44 HELP='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICPGM13 HELP=HLP13 KEYL=SELKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Save Licensed Programs
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROGRAMS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No licensed programs are installed)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?SAVLICPGM LICPGM(&LPID.) OPTION(&LPOPT.) DEV(*SAVF)' HELP='LICPGM13/OPTIONS'.1=Save
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='LICPGM13/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPOPT'.Product Option
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=44 HELP='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICLNG20 HELP=HLPLNG KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Secondary Languages
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=PRILNG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRILNG'.Primary language
:DATAI VAR=PRILNGT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRILNGT'.Description
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LANGS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No secondary languages are installed)
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LNGID'.Secondary Language
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LNGTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICLNG21 HELP=HLPLNG KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Install Secondary Languages
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=PRILNG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRILNG'.Primary language
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LANGS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No other languages are on the media)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 121' HELP='LICLNG21/OPTIONS'.1=Install
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='LICLNG21/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LNGID'.Language Feature
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LNGTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=LICLNG22 HELP=HLPLNG KEYL=PRMKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Delete Secondary Languages
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATAI VAR=PRILNG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PRILNG'.Primary language
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LANGS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No secondary languages are installed)
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 122' HELP='LICLNG22/OPTIONS'.4=Delete
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='LICLNG22/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LNGID'.Secondary Language
:LISTCOL VAR=LNGTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LNGTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKSFWAGR HELP=HLPWAGR KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Software Agreements
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AGRS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No software agreements)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='WRKSFWAGR/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKSFWAGR/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:LISTCOL VAR=LPRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPRLS'.Release
:LISTCOL VAR=AGRSTS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/AGRSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=LPTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=38 HELP='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKLICINF HELP=HLPWLIC KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with License Information
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=LICS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No license information)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?CHGLICINF PRDID(&LPID.) LICTRM(&LICTRM.) FEATURE(&LICFTR.)' HELP='WRKLICINF/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='CMD DSPLICKEY PRDID(&LPID.) LICTRM(&LICTRM.) FEATURE(&LICFTR.)' HELP='WRKLICINF/OPTIONS'.5=Display license key
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKLICINF/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=LPID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LPID'.Product ID
:LISTCOL VAR=LICTRM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LICTRM'.Term
:LISTCOL VAR=LICFTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LICFTR'.Feature
:LISTCOL VAR=LICCMP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LICCMP'.Compliance
:LISTCOL VAR=LICLMT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LICLMT'.Usage Limit
:LISTCOL VAR=LICCNT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/LICCNT'.Usage Count
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLP10.Display Installed Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Each licensed program option installed on the system, with its
installed status: *COMPATIBLE when it is right for this release of the
operating system, *ERROR when a load is not completely installed,
*NOPRIMARY when its primary language objects are missing.
:P.F11 shows the installed release and the product option instead.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP11.Install Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Type 1 next to each licensed program option to install, then press
Enter. The install options come next, then each product's software
agreement, which must be accepted before the product is installed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPINS.Install Options - Help
:P.The installation device is the save file holding the product loads,
as LIBRARY/FILE, until optical and tape media are supported.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPAGR.Software Agreement - Help
:P.Read the agreement. F14 accepts it and the install goes on; F15
declines it and the product is not installed.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP12.Delete Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Type 4 next to each licensed program option to delete. Deleting the
base option deletes every option of the product.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLP13.Save Licensed Programs - Help
:P.Type 1 next to each licensed program option to save into a save
file for installing on another system.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPLNG.Secondary Languages - Help
:P.The language features installed besides the primary language.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWAGR.Work with Software Agreements - Help
:P.The software agreement of each installed product and whether it was
accepted. Option 5 shows the agreement.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPWLIC.Work with License Information - Help
:P.The license terms of each product feature: how use past the usage
limit is handled, the limit and the uses held now.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F11=Display release
:PD.Display release.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F19=Display trademarks
:PD.Display trademarks.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LPID'.Licensed Program
:P.The licensed Program of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/STATUS'.Installed Status
:P.The installed Status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LPTEXT'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/RLSKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F11=Display status
:PD.Display status.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F19=Display trademarks
:PD.Display trademarks.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LPRLS'.Installed Release
:P.The installed Release of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LPOPT'.Product Option
:P.The product Option of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/SELKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F11=Display release
:PD.Display release.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F19=Display trademarks
:PD.Display trademarks.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICPGM11/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICPGM11/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Install
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to install it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/PRMKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/INSDEV'.Installation device (save file)
:P.Type the installation device (save file).
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/INSOBJ'.Objects to install
:P.Type the objects to install.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/INSIPL'.Automatic IPL
:P.Type the automatic IPL.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/AGRKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F14=Accept
:PD.Accept.
:PT.F15=Decline
:PD.Decline.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AGRLINE'.AGRLINE
:P.The AGRLINE of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICPGM12/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICPGM12/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.4=Delete
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to delete it. The Delete
Licensed Program (DLTLICPGM) command runs for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICPGM13/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICPGM13/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Save
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to save it. The Save
Licensed Program (SAVLICPGM) command is prompted for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRILNG'.Primary language
:P.The primary language shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRILNGT'.Description
:P.The description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LNGID'.Secondary Language
:P.The secondary Language of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LNGTEXT'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICLNG21/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='LICLNG21/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.1=Install
:PD.Type 1 next to an entry and press Enter to install it.
