:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSFWAGR/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AGRSTS'.Status
:P.The status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKSFWAGR/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKLICINF/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICTRM'.Term
:P.The term of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICFTR'.Feature
:P.The feature code of the product.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICCMP'.Compliance
:P.The compliance of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICLMT'.Usage Limit
:P.The usage Limit of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICCNT'.Usage Count
:P.The usage Count of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKLICINF/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it. The Change
License Information (CHGLICINF) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.5=Display license key
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display license key it.
The Display License Key Information (DSPLICKEY) command runs for the
entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
